help for {hi:easyclick}
{hline}

{title:Title}
{p 4 4 2}
{bf:easyclick} —— 一键截面数据分析（至少输入两个变量，第一个作为Y，之后的作为X）
One-click cross-section data analysis (enter at least two variables, the first as Y and the subsequent as X)

{title:Syntax}
{p 4 4 2}
{cmdab:easyclick} {varlist}, save(path)

{title:Description}
{p 4 4 2}
{cmd:easyclick} 一键进行截面数据分析并导出结果：
包括描述数据、相关性分析、OLS基准回归、计算VIF值、reset检验、信息准则、异方差检验及处理（若有）。
请确保一些基础外部命令得到安装，如estab、asdoc、outreg2等，还有连玉君老师的pwcorr_a命令，具体安装方法请自行查阅网页。
save中的路径是必填的，否则存储位置会比较乱。

 One-click to perform cross-section data analysis and export the results:
Including describing the data, correlation analysis, OLS baseline regression, calculating the VIF value, reset test, information criterion, heteroscedasticity test and processing (if any). 
Input at least two variables, the first one as Y and the subsequent one as X. Please make sure some basic external commands are installed, such as estab, asdoc, outreg2, etc.
Please check the webpage by yourself for the specific installation method, and the paths in SAVE are required, otherwise the storage location will be messy.

{title:Examples}
{p 4 4 2} *-使用示例数据集auto,dta，以gear_ratio为因变量，以weight和length为自变量进行分析
Use the sample data set auto,dta, with gear_ratio as the dependent variable and weight and length as the independent variables for analysis {p_end}
{p 4 4 2}{inp:.} {stata `"sysuse auto.dta,clear"'}{p_end}
{p 4 4 2}{inp:.} {stata `"easyclick gear_ratio weight length, save(D:\) "'}{p_end}

{title:Author}
